<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Seleccionar Rol</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>:root { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }</style>
</head>
<body class="flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4"
      style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d3f6e 0%, #1370a2 50%, #0f6e56 100%);">

    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-md border border-gray-200">

        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-center text-gray-900 mb-2">
            Bienvenido
        </h1>
        <p class="text-center text-gray-500 mb-8">
            Tu cuenta tiene múltiples roles. ¿Con cuál querés ingresar?
        </p>

        {{#errorMessage}}
        <div class="bg-red-100 border border-red-400 text-red-700 px-4 py-3 rounded mb-6">
            {{errorMessage}}
        </div>
        {{/errorMessage}}

        <form action="/login/role" method="post" class="space-y-4">
            {{#roles}}
            <button type="submit"
                    name="role"
                    value="{{name}}"
                    class="w-full bg-blue-600 text-white py-3 px-6 rounded-full font-bold text-lg shadow-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition duration-300 transform hover:scale-105">
                Ingresar como {{label}}
            </button>
            {{/roles}}
        </form>

        <div class="text-center mt-6">
            <a href="/login"
               class="text-blue-600 hover:underline text-sm">
                Volver al inicio de sesión
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>
